# p0p
P0p is a language. In it's main branch, it lacks some features (it's not really intended to be used by humans though).
In other branches, I'm slowly refactoring the language with more features. You may expect a lot of changes in the future.

## The language is used to create solutions to programming problems.

You're able to make programs the computer runs as long as it satisfies several requirements.

### The following things are needed and understood.
 - Python
 - Go
 - Java

# How to contribute

This language is very simple but it needs more features, optimizations and a new compiler in order to be used.

### The easiest way to contribute is doing some tasks on https://p0p.glitch.me/. You don't need to clone anything. However, if you want to collaborate with me, check my [website](https://p0p.krylova.tech.glitch.me) to get the latest link to the page.

## When contributing
I'd be more than happy to help you understand the language.

### If you use my language
If you feel good about using my language feel free to use it for any purpose. Please don't copy my language.

If you feel like a good friend for your projects
Contact me at [][email]

