# JUG JavaXML

This repository contains examples and exercises for a tutorial session at
[JUG](https://www.meetup.com/JavaUserGroups) in Madrid, 11-13 february 2018 using
the Java XML (java.xml) APIs.

Please refer to [the official JUG slide deck](https://github.com/hpeyerl/jug-javaxml-2018) for
an overview of the exercises.

## Requirements

The only requirements on the examples and exercises are the basic IDE we
use for writing the example and exercise code:
- Eclipse/STS

These requirements are different from the one used for the actual session,
when the programmers were asked to solve problems using a combination of both
Eclipse and IntelliJ IDEA.

## Contributing

These examples and exercises can be used to:
- teach people on how to use the Java XML APIs,
- test their solution to the exercises and
- explore what would be required to make the API more secure.

