[1]
1. The file is saved to the directory, indicated in the rightmost edge of the window
2. The file is read from the buffer and is parsed (according to the file template extension)
3. The read buffer is written to the "continue tab"
3. The testing program is started
4. The tested program is sent the input of the user to the testing program
5. The returned values are parsed to the test
6. The test results are drawn

![Run: Continue & Run](./images/test/Run-Continue-Run.gif)

